    "T03_Abel": "Six selected Lean modules, actual negative Bruhat orbit equals the original prescribed Phi for every original marking, Y>0 and q>0. Exact normalization and common positive ab floor; all log/Euler jets. No level-uniform large sieve claim.",
    "T04_unit_band": "Six modules, genuine K0 height probes and fixed N,m constants C(N,m)(1+T) for both real spectral bands/all frames and incoming cusps. Full raw exceptional squared mass finite without finite exceptional counting. Not the level/frequency-uniform 7/32 estimate.",
    "T21_nuclear": "Nine modules, actual Abel H log-cell countable rank-one expansion, trace-class absolute exchange over full discrete and all incoming continuous cusp spectra, common physical finite-modulus cutoff, every complex-order transformed probe, and original_prescribed_opposite_trace for traceNegative=true. No generic trace-continuity input. Same-sign holomorphic/J and uniform DI/7/32 remain open. The reported failed read-only manuscript-SHA lookup in the wrong partial-clone repository is disclosed in the frozen provenance report; no remote write or CI resulted.",
    "T23_Member": "Five modules, all nine shapes/401 atoms and genuine full mixed QueryMember a.e. stability, symmetric-difference volume->0 and true two-sided native extended-density L1->0. At fixed mesh and epsilon one continuous precision n works for all original programs of depth<=440, both roots, polarities and cells. Arithmetic N0, changing discrete prime screens, cross-chart owner/adopted receipts and full430+11 remain open; Y24/Y28/h34 yellow.",
    "validation": "All four packages independently source reviewed. No Lean compilation, kernel replay, transitive-axiom acceptance or new CI from this docs-only checkpoint. The separate P2r3 actual run43186809155 has compile failure and does not validate these sources.",
    "preserved": "All original green and yellow duties, default branch, original dirty continuation and paused P automations unchanged."
